{"id":"switcherooctl.1","lang":"en","desc":"Launch a command on a specific GPU.","items":[["Enable the switcheroo service","systemctl start switcheroo-control"],["List known GPUs","switcherooctl"],["Launch a command on the first discrete GPU","switcherooctl launch {{command}}"],["Launch a command on a specific GPU","switcherooctl launch {{[-g|--gpu]}} {{device_number}} {{command}}"],["Display help","switcherooctl help"]],"version":"v2.3","source":"https://github.com/tldr-pages/tldr/blob/main/pages/linux/switcherooctl.md"}